                    %mi 𝒦
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{P}A\in |\mathcal{K}|
              called its
              %em object of presheaves
              and an admissible 1-cell
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
