            %em proto-Yoneda structure
            results from replacing ‘admissible’ by ‘proto-admissible’ throughout the definition. Indeed, in (YS3) the assumption that
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
