          %p
            In cases where we need to keep track of from which (proto-)Yoneda structure the various structural 1- and 2-cells come from we will use the presheaf construction as a superscript for disambiguation: for (proto-)Yoneda structure
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
