            in Weber (
            %a{:href => "#Weber07"}> 2007
            ) where it is also shown that Yoneda structures arising from presheaf constructions of the form
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
