            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kan+extension"} Kan extension
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/lax-idempotent+2-monad"} lax-idempotent 2-monad
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/exact+square"} exact square
          %h2#link Link
          %ul
            %li
              n-café seminar blog on the Street-Walters paper: (
              %a{:href => "http://golem.ph.utexas.edu/category/2014/03/an_exegesis_of_yoneda_structur.html"}> link
              )
          %h2#references References
          %p The original articles:
          %ul
            %li#W71
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bob+Walters"}> Bob Walters
                ,
                %em Yoneda 2Categories
                , talk at the University of New South Wales December 1971. (
                %a{:href => "https://web.archive.org/web/20170211062709/https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/92056191/Archive/temporary_new_material/yoneda.pdf"}> manuscript
                )
            %li#KS73
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Max+Kelly"}> Max Kelly
                ,
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ross+Street"} Ross Street
                (eds.),
                %em Abstracts of the Sydney Category Theory Seminar 1972/73
                , Macquarie University.
            %li#SW78
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ross+Street"}> Ross Street
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bob+Walters"} Bob Walters
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Yoneda structures on 2-categories
                %strong 50
                (1978) 350-379 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0021-8693(78)90160-6"}> doi:10.1016/0021-8693(78)90160-6
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p Early variations on the theme:
          %ul
            %li#Street74
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ross+Street"}> Ross Street
                ,
                %em Elementary cosmoi I
                , pp.104-133 in Springer LNM
                %strong 420
                1974.
            %li#Street80
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ross+Street"}> Ross Street
                ,
                %em Cosmoi of internal categories
                , Transactions AMS
                %strong 258
                (1980) pp.271-318.
          %p The quote above stems from:
          %ul
            %li#Street10
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ross+Street"}> Ross Street
              ,
              %em An Australian conspectus of higher categories
              , pp.237-264 in Baez, May (eds.),
              %em Towards Higher Categories
              , Springer Heidelberg 2010. (
              %a{:href => "http://maths.mq.edu.au/~street/Minneapolis.pdf"}> draft
              )
          %p The result on locally small categories suggesting the definition of a small object:
          %ul
            %li#FS95
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+Freyd"}> Peter Freyd
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ross+Street"} Ross Street
              %em On the size of categories
              , TAC
              %strong 1
              (1995) pp.174-185. (
              %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/volumes/1995/n9/1-09abs.html"}> abstract
              )
          %p On exact squares in Yoneda structures:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ren%C3%A9+Guitart"}> René Guitart
                ,
                %em Relations et carrés exacts
                , Ann. Sc. Math. Québec
                %strong IV
                no.2 (1980) pp.103-125. (
                %a{:href => "http://rene.guitart.pagesperso-orange.fr/textespublications/rg42.pdf"}> draft
                )
            %li
              %p
                L. Van den Bril,
                %em Exactitude dans les Yoneda-structures
                , Cah. Top. Géo. Diff. Cat.
                %strong XXIII
                no.2 (1982) pp.215-224.
          %p
            In the generality of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/multicategories"} multicategories
          %ul
            %li#Hermida04
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Claudio+Hermida"}> Claudio Hermida
              \:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Fibrations and Yoneda structure for multicategories
              = succeed "," do
                %em Galois Theory, Hopf Algebras, and Semiabelian Categories
              %strong 43
              (2004) 281-294 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1090/fic/043"}> doi:10.1090/fic/043
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Claudio-Hermida/publication/246180896_Fibrations_for_abstract_multicategories/links/573907ae08ae9f741b2be202/Fibrations-for-abstract-multicategories.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            On Yoneda structures arising from
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-categories"} 2-categories
            with a discrete-opfibration classifier (such as
            = succeed "):" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-toposes"} 2-toposes
          %ul
            %li#Weber07
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mark+Weber"}> Mark Weber
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Yoneda structures from 2-toposes
              %strong 15
              (2007) 259–323 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/s10485-007-9079-2"}> doi:10.1007/s10485-007-9079-2
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://sites.google.com/site/markwebersmaths/home/yoneda-structures-from-2-toposes"} pdf
          %p On relations with KZ doctrines:
          %ul
            %li#BF99
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Marta+Bunge"}> Marta Bunge
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jonathon+Funk"} Jonathon Funk
                %em On a bicomma object condition for KZ-doctrines
                , JPAA
                %strong 143
                (1999) 69-105.
            %li#MW12
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Francisco+Marmolejo"}> Francisco Marmolejo
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Richard+J.+Wood"} Richard J. Wood
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Kan extensions and lax idempotent pseudomonads
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/TAC"} TAC
                %strong 26
                1 (2012) 1-29 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/volumes/26/1/26-01abs.html"}> 26-01
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li#Walker17
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Charles+Walker"}> Charles Walker
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Yoneda Structures and KZ Doctrines
                %strong 222
                6 (2018) 1375–1387 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1703.08693"}> arXiv:1703.08693
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "http://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpaa.2017.07.004"} doi:10.1016/j.jpaa.2017.07.004
            %li#Walker18
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Charles+Walker"}> Charles Walker
                \:
                %em Distributive Laws via Admissibility
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.09575"}> arXiv:1706.09575
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li#DL18
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ivan+Di+Liberti"}> Ivan Di Liberti
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Fosco+Loregian"} Fosco Loregian
                %em Accessibility and Presentability in 2-Categories
                , arXiv:1804.08710 (2018). (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1804.08710"}> abstract
                )
          %p The relation to pro-arrow equipments, the presheaf construction and Isbell duality:
          %ul
            %li#DL19
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ivan+Di+Liberti"}> Ivan Di Liberti
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Fosco+Loregian"} Fosco Loregian
